# https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/50863  (PR head e8119d699d)
# Generated against the image's SGLang checkout (1ced9a9eb0) with patches 01-14 applied; source files only (tests dropped).
# The benchmarked revision, an earlier form of the PR's kernels: opt-in SGLANG_AMD_HC_PREFILL=1 (the PR's switch is
# SGLANG_USE_HIP_HC_PREFILL_TRITON). HC sites above the decode fused row cap run as one batched GEMM over the raw
